915","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI100215","name":{"zh":"琅琊伏氏","en":"The Fu clan of Langya"},"years":["0","215"],"desc":{"zh":"出自先秦经学世家，秦博士伏胜之后，世传“伏氏学”。汉光武帝时伏湛拜大司徒，封不其侯，传六世至伏完。汉末外戚世家，伏完娶桓帝女阳安长公主，女伏寿为献帝皇后。经学传家，历仕两汉，后因谋诛曹操事泄被灭族，百余口遇害，四百余年名门自此凋零。","en":"Originating from a pre-Qin scholarly lineage of the Classics, descendants of Fu Sheng, Erudite of Qin, who passed down the 'Fu Clan Teachings' for generations. During the reign of Emperor Guangwu of Han, Fu Zhan was appointed Grand Minister of Education and enfeoffed as Marquis of Buqi, passing down through six generations to Fu Wan. A prominent consort kin Family in the late Han dynasty, Fu Wan married Princess Yang'an, daughter of Emperor Huan, and his daughter Fu Shou became the Empress of Emperor Xian. Upholding classical scholarship across generations and serving through both Han dynasties, the clan was later exterminated after their plot to execute Cao Cao was exposed, with over a hundred lives lost, causing a prestigious lineage of over 400 years to wither away."},"talent":{"military":"4","commerce":"2","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[54,43,65,67,51,42],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[54,43,65,67,51,42],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]